Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a glorious place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek freedom, and it will lie\Nstretched out before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides\Nyour restless spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seize it, raise your flag, and stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.12,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.12,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. But I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.46,0:01:09.84,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.46,0:01:09.84,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.02,0:01:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great long blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weighing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.72,0:01:17.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.72,0:01:17.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.94,0:01:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.60,0:01:24.69,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.60,0:01:24.69,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what I am for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.66,0:01:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I've traveled far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.36,0:01:31.90,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.36,0:01:31.90,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overseas of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.90,0:01:35.62,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Timing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.90,0:01:35.62,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}PhosCity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.58,0:01:41.83,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.58,0:01:41.83,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Nirm\NRealFolk\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.
