Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.71,0:01:53.93,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\c&HE6E6E6&\bord0\blur0.6\fsp-2\4a&HFF&}Never Dream
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.76,0:01:53.93,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\bord1.8\blur0.6\3c&H151515&\c&H151515&\fsp-2\1a&HFF&\t(955,1000,\1a&H00&)}Never Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:01:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:01:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One tooth is the size of our\Nboat! That's it! We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just one big stupid dream that\Nwe're all having together for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dream, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our boys just got eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did that ship we\Nwere trying to salvage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, most definitely eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see the air hoses\Ndangling from its jaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see my hair and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who said it would be\Nsafe at the bottom of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what qualifies\Nas safe in your book,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in mine, it's not man-eating turtles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as good as it's gonna get, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't cut the air hoses, that beast
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will drag us down to\Nthe bottom of the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you do just do\Nsomething you're the tough and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smart lady give me a minute I'll see\NI'll see what I can come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to save our noble captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our pride, honor, and lives are at stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our captain is alive and we will find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's these challenging times that\Nprove the streak by which we are made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the air hoses and get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.52,0:04:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what we're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like everything got dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it so dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to leave, guys! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a bad omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know the suddenly darkened sun is\Nthe harbinger of the monsters to soon rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, we've got to save the\Nboss and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Sanji! Set sail now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.38,0:04:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that guy's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get away from the\Nstinky turtle as fast as we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't a turtle, it was a monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bonafide sea monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't say I'm too surprised that he and\NLuffy got along as well as they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're both monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when he caught a glimpse of all the\Nstuff that we had taken from his ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he totally flipped out\Nand went on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a primate\Nact like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Masira, the\Nking of all salvagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But never mind him, how did the three\Nof you escape from the giant sea turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, why do you keep\Ntalking about a turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's just floating there like a\Nstatue with his mouth gaping open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you guys escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in that thing's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets past you guys, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the turtle that ate\Nthe ship you were inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, when did night happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention all hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.49,0:05:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand over the treasure you stole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'll tear your ship apart\Nand find all of it anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys found some treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sure did! Tons of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he starts rampaging\Nthe ship we all go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm? Behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That couldn't have been real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those things were taller than the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:08:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is an endless\Nparade of mysteries and annoyance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at the nightmare\Nof just making it through today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First there was that huge galleon that\Nfell from the clouds on top of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose's needle\Nstarted pointing to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A psycho makeup wearing monkey\Nshows up and blocks our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then a gigantic sea turtle\Ncame and ate our salvage ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then darkness fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the biggest monsters I've ever\Nseen in my life blocked out the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit, even I was\Nintimidated by those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those monsters were too big\Nfor any of us to take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I never see them again,\Nit would be a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I really cut loose, I could have\Ntaught those sea monsters a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought ten of those things a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought ten of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you at least tried to find something\Ndown there that we could actually use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you brought back was\Na bunch of scattered junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single clue here\Nabout how to get to Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't anything there, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We looked. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there was something else down\Nthere, we would have found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship was in terrible shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all jacked up like it had\Nmaybe been attacked and raided.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a mutiny had\Nbroken out and they all killed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,each other in a violent\Nstruggle for power and survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look around boys this is exactly why we\Nneed more information intelligence means the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,difference between life and death for this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whole crew and if we're\Ngonna sail to Sky Island
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we need more information to stay alive\Nor whatever happened to that ship could
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:10:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happen to us too we didn't\Nbrave giant monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you could bring back a creepy octopus
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.02,0:10:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some rusty swords, and a broken dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all junk, and you're all idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she crushed the armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you didn't even notice the\Npretty seashells I brought you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cram your seashells in your shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful when she's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should still try\Nto keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only gonna get worse\Nworking with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never figure out how\Nthat ship sailed to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna snap on them any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eternal pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I took it off that\Nsalvager's ship earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one I can depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.28,0:11:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, who's up for\Nan octopus dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy has got to learn to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaya, this must have been their home port?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaya, is that where we're going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be your decision, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set our course to Jaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, any of you know which\Ndirection that might be? Starbird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard her, chopper. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onward to Jaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hold up just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we head off to this Jaya\Nplace that's so important,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't the Log Pose's needle\Nchange its position again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if that happens, we won't\Nknow which direction Sky Island is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands full, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to tell me why you're\Nmessing with my head, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:11:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the genius who\Ndecided we should go to Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't know it was going to\Nruin our plans to get to Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you have\Nthe memory of a goldfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, the log poses always\Nwork that way, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess so. Hey! Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an important announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as I'm the captain, I say\Nwe set our course for Skypiea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you propose we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to ask\Nfor some directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone in Jaya will know the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, Jaya it is. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On to Jaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.32,0:12:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt that the needle would\Nchange as soon as we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't we pull into port and then\Nleave before it has a chance to adjust?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're lucky, it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a plan to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full sail to Jaya, people,\Nand this time it's for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop stuffing your\Nfaces and get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what this Jaya place is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, my sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:12:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dinner is served!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.31,0:13:15.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord8\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\shad0.01\blur20\4a&H80&\fsp1\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\pos(720,581.8)}Roshio "the Executioner"\NCaptain of the Roshio Pirates\NBounty: 42 Million Belly
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.31,0:13:15.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\bord0\blur0.5\fsp0\pos(720,581.8)}Roshio "the Executioner"\NCaptain of the Roshio Pirates\NBounty: 42 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like that's the last of your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wanted to, I'd let you\Nraise with, say, your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky and you don't even know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playing with Roshio, even if\Nyou would have won the hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you would have\Nlost something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that about wraps it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cheated this entire hand, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never cheat, you're a liar. You lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I watched every deceitful move you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch your mouth\Nin this place, loser Sargus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Sargus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy was cheating just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw the whole thing didn't you you\Nbet I did every rotten little move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cheated straight through\NI said we do something
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about this guy make an example out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.97,0:14:32.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord8\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\shad0.01\blur20\4a&H80&\fsp1\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\pos(720,561.8)}Bellamy "the Hyena"\NCaptain of the Bellamy Pirates\NBounty: 55 Million Belly
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.97,0:14:32.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\bord0\blur0.5\fsp0\pos(720,561.8)}Bellamy "the Hyena"\NCaptain of the Bellamy Pirates\NBounty: 55 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see anything, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the sky and the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.54,0:14:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the Jaya Island wasn't\Ntoo far from where we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with the weather being so clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should have spotted the\Ncoastline over an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to like Jai if\Nit's as warm as it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally getting to work on my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spring weather's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Scales\Nare enjoying it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:14:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be eating good tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think they could\Nhave been shot, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear any gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found a bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And judging from the trajectory,\Nit came from that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying the shots came from\Nan island we can't even see yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I saw it happen with my own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tuna had a better\Nchance at killing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sniper or gun has that kind of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were probably shot before\Nand just happen to fall now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we found our dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to get an\Ninstant kill on one of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord7\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\shad0.01\blur20\4a&H80&\fsp1\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\pos(720,693.8)}West Coast, Jaya
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\bord0\blur0.5\fsp0\pos(720,693.8)}West Coast, Jaya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's what fate held for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the events of his life\Ndestined him to this outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting champion ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it just me or does this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place look like a resort?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure does!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does look promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can even stay here a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either I'm starting to hallucinate or the\Nharbor over there is full of pirate ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since when can pirates dock their ships\Nin a harbor without being run out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.59,0:16:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going\Non with this crazy town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic little weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Missy, you picked\Nthe wrong guy to beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that emblem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in Rocio's gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have heard of Race, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the executioner whose\Nbounty is 42 million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man is psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is full of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We watched that entire game ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe he was\Nable to beat up Race so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that's Bellamy? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with the 55\Nmillion bounty on his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did this to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get him to a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.91,0:17:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this looks like my kind of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have no problem fitting in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think those two can last an\Nhour without getting into any trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, by the looks of this place, I'd\Nsay 15 minutes is a generous assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better say... Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Saru! Wait for me! I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.49,0:18:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be fine with\Nthose two protecting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can protect Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master D!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami will be safe and\Nsound with Luffy and Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.30,0:18:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you leave, then what are we\Nsupposed to do if this ship is attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.96,0:18:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna protect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll make some tea\Nand hold down the fort, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did Robin go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, about that tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.02,0:18:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my tough face on, so\Nif anybody messes with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, whatever, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, this is serious business, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks for the support.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, if one of you causes trouble here,\Nwe'll have to get out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that happens, then we'll never\Nknow how to get to the Sky Island, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he fell off his horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's in pain, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to bother you,\Nbut will you help me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, are you not in the\Nmood to help yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, give me a hand. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my horse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a sickly child growing\Nup and never got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A horse, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should put them out of their misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't have enough money for a\Nreward these days, but care for an apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you take us for idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:19:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd never trust food\Nfrom someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! Apples! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some guys took a few apples\Nfrom that freak on the horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when they bit it\Nto them, they exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit out the apple you just ate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already swallowed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worries, the boy isn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but the inside's destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had eaten the bad one, you\Nwould have died on the first bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.74,0:20:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Oshio's grave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a war broke out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they fire a cannon into the\Nmiddle of town or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the people who were\Nthere and saw what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said they couldn't tell\Nexactly what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About the only thing\Neveryone knows for certain
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that Bellamy had\Nsomething to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy the hyena?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's pretty obvious that he's\Nusing the power of one of the devil fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.18,0:21:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who really cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should care, seeing as you\Nwere almost killed for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was bound to\Nhappen sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many victims has he racked up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's a famous\Nfugitive or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care, and to be\Nhonest, I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that meathead wants to be the fighting\Nchampion, then go ahead and let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't even think about it, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to wonder if we can\Nfind any useful information here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems pretty quiet to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think such an oasis exists in\Nthe middle of this disgusting town?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's built above the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.26,0:22:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, but there's no one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I can smell\Nthat someone's cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I'm going to have to\Nask you all to leave, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, the entire hotel has\Nbeen rented out by Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy and his guests And\Nhe's asked that we tell
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.68,0:22:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other guests like yourselves\Nto go somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.50,0:22:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So uh you must understand that\NI have no say in the matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So one man rented out\Nthis entire place? If Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.36,0:22:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy sees you here, he'll have\Nmy head removed from my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so please leave for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm sure he won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this Bellamy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these scumbags, and what\Nare they doing in our hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.29,0:22:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sargus, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told them to leave,\Nbut they won't listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.56,0:22:56.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord10\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\shad0.01\blur20\4a&H80&\fsp1\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\pos(720,561.8)}"Big Knife" Sarquiss\NFirst Mate, Bellamy Pirates\NBounty: 36 Million Belly
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.56,0:22:56.81,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\bord0\blur0.5\fsp0\pos(720,561.8)}"Big Knife" Sarquiss\NFirst Mate, Bellamy Pirates\NBounty: 36 Million Belly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.84,0:22:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're paying a lot of money to\Nhave this place to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:22:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of here\Nbefore I throw you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, would you\Nmind if I beat him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.79,0:23:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.71,0:23:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.62,0:23:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to beat me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha! Hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, go buy some new rags so\Nyou don't look like an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sargus, you're wasting your money by\Ntossing it to this bunch of losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have just flushed\Nit down along with my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take free money!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.49,0:23:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These jerks can't help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can walk on my own, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sargus, Lily, just\Nleave well enough alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.38,0:23:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eddie, we've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that trash you ran into?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they've been doing\Npretty well for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.32,0:23:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, but nothing\Ncompared to you and Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.99,0:23:51.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord8\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\shad0.01\blur20\4a&H80&\fsp1\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\pos(720,693.8)}The Bellamy Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:23:44.99,0:23:51.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs90\fscx85\fscy85\bord0\blur0.5\fsp0\pos(720,693.8)}The Bellamy Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for ordinary scum,\Nthey can hold their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.62,0:23:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They still don't stand a chance of\Nsurviving the transition into the new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His bounty is 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:23:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For such a little puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Bellamy will want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that really pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shame, because you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mocktown's economy depends\Non pirates throwing money
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around to show off power\Nthey may or may not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, so poor pirates aren't\Nallowed on the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.56,0:24:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's no\Nway of calming you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this one's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.60,0:24:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough guys and degenerates are a clientele\Nhere, so trouble isn't hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.14,0:24:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't going to make it in\Nthis town if you let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to play it safe\Nwhen you can. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.52,0:24:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole town's a real dump, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's how most\Nlevel-headed people would think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately for you, level-headed\Npeople are rare in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.78,0:24:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wanted posters won't be on\Nthe walls for a couple of days,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you may want to skip town\Nsooner rather than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple days?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.96,0:24:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't give us much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now here's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.18,0:24:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.93,0:24:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.85,0:24:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's Bacchi's fucking delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.36,0:25:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of the worst\Ndrinks I've ever tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.64,0:25:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there may be something\Nwrong with your taste buds, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.96,0:25:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there's something\Nwrong with your big fat head.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.90,0:25:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not the cook in this joint,\Nso I don't care what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.90,0:25:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.94,0:25:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barkeep, I'll take 50 steaks to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.10,0:25:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll take 51 of those\Ndelicious cherry pies to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, make that 52 steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.70,0:25:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better make that 53 pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifty-four steaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifty-five pies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.34,0:25:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sixty steaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.52,0:25:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seventy pies! Eighty! A hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the living crap out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you even have the slightest\Nidea what you're fighting about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.18,0:25:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you promised, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.06,0:25:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't have enough\Nmoney to buy dozens of steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.90,0:25:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't here to shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.98,0:25:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, so then, are you a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.84,0:25:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How big's your bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirty million.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thirty million?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.00,0:25:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't believe it\Neven if I collected it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you calling me a\Nliar, you fat, hairy ape?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.92,0:26:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.88,0:26:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got rules in this place,\Nand one of them's no fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.34,0:26:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your 50 cherry pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.92,0:26:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now please, just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a pirate\Nthat wears a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.78,0:26:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.96,0:26:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you must be Straw Hat\NLuffy worth a cool 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.36,0:26:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he has a bone\Nto pick with you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.82,0:26:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be that Bellamy guy that\Nrented out the hotel we were at.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.18,0:26:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.12,0:26:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid's worth 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.84,0:26:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:26:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.54,0:27:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come everyone I meet\Nin this town is so tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.42,0:27:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a glass from the top shelf\Nand give the kid whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.54,0:27:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.54,0:27:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.94,0:27:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This joint is packed solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.46,0:27:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells like vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.44,0:27:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you can get here is cheap rum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.56,0:27:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.47,0:27:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's those guys from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.98,0:27:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be in a lot less pain if\Nyou just offered us your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic harbor trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.48,0:27:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him, Big Knife Sarquiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.20,0:27:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much you want to bet\Nhe's looking for a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.42,0:27:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.98,0:27:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole gang is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.44,0:27:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they stopped\Nin just for a bite to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.20,0:27:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.11,0:27:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.94,0:27:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Bellamy up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.86,0:27:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The usual fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.28,0:27:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.42,0:27:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for the drink, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.04,0:27:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.72,0:28:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.36,0:28:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brilliant move, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the question you\Nshould be asking yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.64,0:28:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.42,0:28:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still need to get some\Ninformation from - Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy wants a fight,\NI'll give it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.20,0:28:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's all you've got for backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.04,0:28:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, are you ready to take me on or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.72,0:28:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid just challenged Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be slaughtered!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.14,0:28:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:28:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a test. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.84,0:29:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how strong you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.74,0:29:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mister, we're trying to\Nget to the Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.72,0:29:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she just say Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.66,0:29:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.52,0:29:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I was saying, if you know\Nhow to get to Sky Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.84,0:29:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is who I think it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island, what an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.81,0:29:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can look at the long pose yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.88,0:29:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointed at the sky, plain as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.90,0:29:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I look like the log foes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.04,0:29:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one trusts those things anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They break if you breathe wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.42,0:30:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you guys\Nare putting open to such
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ridiculous legend like\Nan island in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially considering\Nhow little you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.60,0:30:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like at the thousands of weird currents\Ncutting through the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.28,0:30:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the weirdest is\Ncalled the knock-up stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.94,0:30:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks to me like this is\Nthe first you've ever heard
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.54,0:30:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About it, any ship that\Ngets caught in a knock-up
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stream is catapulted into\Nthe sky and later slams back
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the ocean years ago a\Nbunch of ignorant sailors saw
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.48,0:30:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ships falling from the sky\Nand assumed there must be
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an island up there somewhere\Nin their minds how else
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.32,0:30:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could a ship get up that high?\NRidiculous! Anything that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems supernatural always\Nhas a rational explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.60,0:30:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything a man can\Ndream will eventually be
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explained and let me tell\Nyou the truth will hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.68,0:30:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.22,0:30:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I was gonna let you join my
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.78,0:30:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crew if you'd pass the test of the new\Nera, but it seems like you're a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.96,0:31:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, the time of\Npirates' dreams is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold, the Emerald\NRuins, and the Great One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fools who dream of\Nthese fictional treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.34,0:31:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't notice the real\Ntreasures that surround them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.68,0:31:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this age of oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.18,0:31:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the very men who are brave enough\Nand capable of navigating currents
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end up chasing these ridiculous\Ndreams and die in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.46,0:31:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever people speak\Nof these dead idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they always say he was happy\Nbecause he died living his dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.44,0:31:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he died because he was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when I see people chasing dreams\Nof One Piece, I get disgusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.56,0:31:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.74,0:31:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a weak pirate, just like they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.44,0:31:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as you're hacking\Naround, you'll make us,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.62,0:31:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the real pirates, look like trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.30,0:31:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you scrawny punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.50,0:31:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're killing our bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.88,0:31:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.70,0:31:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bellamy, give these people what they want!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.68,0:32:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.10,0:32:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be more than happy to entertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.74,0:32:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro, forget all that pacifist\Ncrap I was talking about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.06,0:32:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And take this jerk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.38,0:32:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.18,0:32:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, don't fight back.

